      "2 application(s) report Compliant while holding out-of-compliance controls: SAP Fiori (7661e43483431210bd2a5860ceaad360) reads \"compliant\" while 4 of 6 controls are out_of_compliance; SAP HANA (6e81683483431210bd2a5860ceaad398) reads \"compliant\" while 4 of 6 controls are out_of_compliance"
    ],
    "verdictReason": "2 business application(s) are reported compliant while controls are out of compliance. Severity: high — this is the headline number on the compliance dashboard.",
